<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ملتقى الرخصة المهنية | رياضيات - بنك المعايير الشامل</title>
    
    <!-- الخطوط المعتمدة -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Tajawal:wght@400;500;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- محرك المعادلات KaTeX -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.8/dist/katex.min.css">
    <script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.8/dist/katex.min.js"></script>
    <script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.8/dist/contrib/auto-render.min.js"></script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-purple: #512da8;
            --dark-purple: #311b92;
            --light-purple: #f3e8ff;
            --border-purple: #6b21a8;
            --success-green: #10b981;
            --danger-red: #ef4444;
            --warning-gold: #f59e0b;
            --bg-grid-color: rgba(107, 33, 168, 0.05);
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-dark: #1e1b4b;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            background-color: #faf5ff;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(to right, var(--bg-grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--bg-grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 22px 22px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            user-select: none;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-purple), var(--primary-purple));
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(81, 45, 168, 0.25);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .header-content {
            max-width: 1050px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
        }

        .header-title h1 {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .header-title span {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #d8b4fe;
        }

        .header-tools {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .btn-tool {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            color: white;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .btn-tool:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-finish {
            background: var(--warning-gold) !important;
            color: #1e1b4b !important;
            border-color: #fde68a !important;
            font-weight: 800 !important;
            display: none;
        }

        .btn-finish:hover {
            background: #d97706 !important;
            color: white !important;
        }

        .control-bar {
            background: white;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e9d5ff;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
        }

        .control-bar-inner {
            max-width: 1050px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .standard-select-box {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .standard-select-box select {
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1.8px solid var(--border-purple);
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--dark-purple);
            background: #faf5ff;
            outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .mode-selector {
            display: flex;
            background: #f3e8ff;
            padding: 3px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #d8b4fe;
        }

        .mode-btn {
            border: none;
            background: transparent;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary-purple);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .mode-btn.active {
            background: var(--primary-purple);
            color: white;
        }

        .timer-badge {
            background: #fef3c7;
            color: #92400e;
            border: 1px solid #fde68a;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            display: none;
        }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 1050px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 0 15px;
        }

        .standard-banner {
            background: white;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-purple);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(107, 33, 168, 0.08);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .standard-banner::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 8px;
            background: var(--primary-purple);
        }

        .standard-info h2 {
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--dark-purple);
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .standard-info p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .page-counter-badge {
            background: var(--light-purple);
            color: var(--primary-purple);
            border: 1px solid #d8b4fe;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .page-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .question-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1.8px solid var(--border-purple);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(107, 33, 168, 0.04);
        }

        .q-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #e9d5ff;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
        }

        .q-num {
            background: var(--primary-purple);
            color: white;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            padding: 2px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .q-tag {
            background: #ede9fe;
            color: #5b21b6;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid #c4b5fd;
        }

        .q-body {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .options-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .options-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .options-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .option-box {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: all 0.15s ease;
        }

        .option-box:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary-purple);
            background: #faf5ff;
        }

        .opt-letter {
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: #475569;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .opt-text {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .option-box.selected {
            border-color: var(--primary-purple);
            background: var(--light-purple);
        }
        .option-box.selected .opt-letter {
            background: var(--primary-purple);
            color: white;
        }
        .option-box.correct {
            border-color: var(--success-green) !important;
            background: #ecfdf5 !important;
            color: #065f46;
        }
        .option-box.correct .opt-letter {
            background: var(--success-green) !important;
            color: white !important;
        }
        .option-box.wrong {
            border-color: var(--danger-red) !important;
            background: #fef2f2 !important;
            color: #991b1b;
        }
        .option-box.wrong .opt-letter {
            background: var(--danger-red) !important;
            color: white !important;
        }

        .q-explanation {
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-right: 4px solid var(--primary-purple);
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            display: none;
        }

        .answer-key-bar {
            background: white;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-purple);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .answer-key-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--dark-purple);
        }

        .toggle-key-btn {
            background: var(--primary-purple);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .answer-key-items {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .key-token {
            background: #faf5ff;
            border: 1px solid #d8b4fe;
            padding: 2px 7px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .key-token.hidden-key {
            filter: blur(5px);
            user-select: none;
        }

        .page-footer-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .pagination-controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 25px 0 35px 0;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
        }

        .page-nav-btn {
            background: white;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-purple);
            color: var(--primary-purple);
            padding: 7px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .page-nav-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
            background: var(--primary-purple);
            color: white;
        }

        .page-nav-btn:disabled {
            opacity: 0.4;
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }

        #resultModal {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
            z-index: 1050;
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
        }

        .result-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            max-width: 480px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 28px 24px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 2.5px solid var(--border-purple);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        }

        .score-circle {
            width: 110px;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--light-purple);
            border: 4px solid var(--primary-purple);
            margin: 15px auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .score-circle .score-num {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--dark-purple);
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .score-circle .score-max {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #64748b;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        #indexModal {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            z-index: 1000;
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 15px;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
        }

        .index-card {
            background: white;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-purple);
            border-radius: 14px;
            max-width: 750px;
            width: 100%;
            max-height: 85vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .index-header {
            background: var(--dark-purple);
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .index-body {
            padding: 20px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 12px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .index-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .index-item {
            background: #faf5ff;
            border: 1.5px solid #d8b4fe;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .index-item:hover {
            background: var(--light-purple);
            border-color: var(--primary-purple);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .index-item-title {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--dark-purple);
        }

        .index-item-count {
            background: var(--primary-purple);
            color: white;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        #scratchpadModal {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
            z-index: 999;
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        .scratchpad-window {
            background: white;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            height: 80vh;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 2px solid var(--primary-purple);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .scratchpad-header {
            background: var(--dark-purple);
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
        }

        .scratchpad-toolbar {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
        }

        .tool-chip {
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            background: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .tool-chip.active {
            background: var(--primary-purple);
            color: white;
        }

        #scratchCanvas {
            flex: 1;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(to right, rgba(81, 45, 168, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(81, 45, 168, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 20px 20px;
            cursor: crosshair;
            touch-action: none;
        }
              /* ضبط اتجاه المعادلات والأسس ومنع انقلاب الأقواس */
        .katex {
            direction: ltr !important;
            display: inline-block !important;
            unicode-bidi: isolate !important;
            white-space: nowrap !important;
        }

        .katex-html {
            direction: ltr !important;
            unicode-bidi: isolate !important;
            white-space: nowrap !important;
        }

        .opt-text {
            direction: ltr !important;
            unicode-bidi: isolate !important;
            text-align: center;
        }

      
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="header-content">
            <div class="header-title">
                <h1>ملتقى الرخصة المهنية | رياضيات (المستوى الثاني)</h1>
                <span>المرحلة المتوسطة والثانوية — التجميعة الشاملة للمعايير</span>
            </div>
            <div class="header-tools">
                <button class="btn-tool btn-finish" id="examFinishBtn" onclick="finishExam()">
                    🏁 إنهاء وتسليم الاختبار
                </button>
                <button class="btn-tool" onclick="openIndexModal()">
                    📋 فهرس المعايير
                </button>
                <button class="btn-tool" onclick="openScratchpad()">
                    ✏️ المسودة
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="control-bar">
        <div class="control-bar-inner">
            <div class="standard-select-box">
                <label for="standardSelect" style="font-weight:800; font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--dark-purple);">المعيار الحالي:</label>
                <select id="standardSelect" onchange="onSelectStandardChange(this.value)">
                    <option value="all">🌟 جميع المعايير (اختبار شامل)</option>
                    <option value="1" selected>المعيار الأول: الأعداد والعمليات عليها</option>
                    <option value="2">المعيار الثاني: الجبر والدوال والتحليل</option>
                    <option value="3">المعيار الثالث: الهندسة والقياس</option>
                    <option value="5">المعيار الخامس: الإحصاء والاحتمالات</option>
                    <option value="6">المعيار السادس: المنطق والاستدلال</option>
                    <option value="7">المعيار السابع: التحليل الرياضي</option>
                    <option value="8">المعايير التربوية (8 إلى 12)</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;">
                <div class="timer-badge" id="examTimerBadge">
                    ⏱️ الوقت المتبقي: <span id="timerDisplay">45:00</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mode-selector">
                    <button class="mode-btn active" id="modePracticeBtn" onclick="switchMode('practice')">
                        تدريب مباشر
                    </button>
                    <button class="mode-btn" id="modeExamBtn" onclick="switchMode('exam')">
                        اختبار محاكي
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main>
        <div class="standard-banner">
            <div class="standard-info">
                <h2 id="bannerTitle">المعيار الأول: الأعداد والعمليات عليها</h2>
                <p id="bannerSubtitle">مجموعات الأعداد، العمليات، الجذور والأسس، ونظرية الأعداد</p>
            </div>
            <div class="page-counter-badge" id="pageIndicator">
                الصفحة 1 من 1
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="page-container" id="questionsContainer"></div>

        <div class="answer-key-bar" id="pageAnswerKeyBar">
            <div class="answer-key-header">
                <span>مفتاح إجابات هذه الصفحة (مطابق لملف المراجعة المعتمد)</span>
                <button class="toggle-key-btn" onclick="togglePageKey()">إظهار / إخفاء المفتاح</button>
            </div>
            <div class="answer-key-items" id="answerKeyItemsContainer"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="page-footer-info">
            <span id="footerPageNumber">صفحة 1 | المعيار</span>
            <span>ملتقى الرخصة المهنية | إعداد أ. عبدالرحمن، أ. فيصل، أ. وليد</span>
        </div>

        <div class="pagination-controls">
            <button class="page-nav-btn" id="prevPageBtn" onclick="prevPage()">
                ⬅️ الصفحة السابقة
            </button>
            <span style="font-weight:700; color:var(--dark-purple);" id="pageNumLabel">صفحة 1</span>
            <button class="page-nav-btn" id="nextPageBtn" onclick="nextPage()">
                الصفحة التالية ➡️
            </button>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- نافذة نتيجة الاختبار النهائي -->
    <div id="resultModal">
        <div class="result-card">
            <h2 style="color:var(--dark-purple); margin-bottom:8px;">📊 تقرير نتيجة الاختبار</h2>
            <p id="resStandardTitle" style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:12px;">المعيار الأول: الأعداد والعمليات عليها</p>

            <div class="score-circle">
                <div class="score-num" id="resScoreNum">0</div>
                <div class="score-max">من <span id="resTotalNum">0</span></div>
